sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant B as Browser
    participant C as Client App
    participant A as Auth Server

    C->>C: Generate code_verifier + code_challenge (SHA-256)
    C->>B: Redirect to /authorize
    B->>A: GET /authorize with code_challenge and state
    A->>B: Login page
    U->>B: Submit credentials
    B->>A: POST credentials
    A->>B: 302 redirect with authorization code
    B->>C: GET /callback with code and state
    C->>C: Verify state, retrieve code_verifier
    C->>A: POST /token with code + code_verifier (back channel)
    A->>A: Hash verifier, compare to stored challenge
    A->>C: access_token
    C->>A: POST /introspect with token (back channel)
    A->>C: active, scope, sub, expiry
